WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.263
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Bullying Bystander Power Moves.

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:18.526
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:18.526 --> 00:00:21.684
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:21.684 --> 00:00:24.841
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:24.841 --> 00:00:34.315
Sometimes we see unkindness aimed at someone else — teasing that hurts, leaving someone out on purpose.

00:00:34.315 --> 00:00:43.788
The person who sees it is called a bystander. And a bystander is not powerless.

00:00:43.788 --> 00:00:50.103
There are strong, safe moves a bystander can make. We practice them here, on pretend moments only.

00:00:50.103 --> 00:00:54.314
One rule first, the most important one: you never have to fix it alone. Grown-ups are part of every move.

00:00:54.314 --> 00:01:04.839
Move one, the strongest move: tell a grown-up. A teacher, a counselor — an adult you trust.

00:01:04.839 --> 00:01:12.207
Pretend with me: at recess, you see someone being teased, again and again. What do you do?

00:01:12.207 --> 00:01:21.681
You walk to a grown-up and say: "Someone is being teased by the fence. They need help."

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:32.206
Telling is not tattling. Telling gets help. It is the strongest move you have.

00:01:32.206 --> 00:01:41.680
Move two: after, stand near. Be beside the person, so they are not standing alone.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:50.100
Move three: invite them in. "Come build with us." Four small words that open a door.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:57.468
Move four: a kind word, after. "I saw what happened. It wasn't okay. I'm glad you're here."

00:01:57.468 --> 00:02:03.784
And what we never do: never step between, never push back, never tease back. Those are not safe moves.

00:02:03.784 --> 00:02:11.152
Tell a grown-up. Stand near. Invite in. Say the kind word. Those are your power moves.

00:02:11.152 --> 00:02:19.573
If a real moment is happening — not pretend — the move is the same, and it is move one: get a grown-up, right away.

00:02:19.573 --> 00:02:22.730
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:26.941
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:26.941 --> 00:02:31.151
You're ready for what's next.
